<title>HONG KONG: China Inv interim net loss HK$18.27 mln.</title>
<headline>China Inv interim net loss HK$18.27 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.9 loss   vs 16.5 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  4.52 loss  vs 27.62 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    18.27 loss vs 51.41 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     209.29     vs 44.07</p>
<p>    Company name		 China Investments Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - China Investments is an investment holding and property development firm.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on disposal of property and provision for loss on cessation of electroplating manufacturing operation.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
